            "Player": 10
        }
    },
    "talks": [
        {
            "id": "7066401",
            "objective": "Talk to Honglang",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "706640101",
                    "speaker": "Honglang",
                    "text": "Every time there's trouble, they send me to fix it...",
                    "choices": [
                        {
                            "id": "706640102",
                            "text": "Oh, aren't you...?",
                            "response": [
                                {
                                    "id": "706640104",
                                    "speaker": "Honglang",
                                    "text": "It's you! What a coincidence! I never expected to meet you here of all places."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "706640105",
                                    "speaker": "Player",
                                    "text": "What are you doing here?"
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "706640106",
                                    "speaker": "Honglang",
                                    "text": "*sigh* Don't ask. Remember that peculiar Domain? You know... the one where the internal structure changed according to one's mind?"
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "706640107",
                                    "speaker": "Honglang",
                                    "text": "I was able to gather quite a lot of information thanks to your help in getting me in there to explore. After the Domain disappeared, I went back to report to Lan."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "706640108",
                                    "speaker": "Honglang",
                                    "text": "I reiterated to her that I couldn't have managed this case without your help. I only provided a negligible amount of support."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "706640109",
                                    "speaker": "Honglang",
                                    "text": "But she wouldn't listen and even commended my work before asking me to lead a team to explore more unknown Domains of that sort.",
                                    "choices": [
                                        {
                                            "id": "706640110",
                                            "text": "That doesn't sound like a half bad gig.",
                                            "response": [
                                                {
                                                    "id": "706640112",
                                                    "speaker": "Honglang",
                                                    "text": "What's so good about it? I used to just be a regular old adventurer with nothing stopping me from doing whatever I pleased."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "706640113",
                                                    "speaker": "Honglang",
                                                    "text": "I may have earned less before, but I had my freedom. Now I'm stuck with this title Lan gave me..."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "706640114",
                                                    "speaker": "Honglang",
                                                    "text": "Enough about that, let's get down to business. See this door beside me? Behind it is another peculiar Domain."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "706640115",
                                                    "speaker": "Honglang",
                                                    "text": "And this Domain is chock-a-block full of wind currents."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "706640116",
                                                    "speaker": "Player",
                                                    "text": "Wind currents? As in the usual kind?"
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "706640117",
                                                    "speaker": "Honglang",
                                                    "text": "Yep, you know, those whooshing, swooshing wind currents you find outside. Adventurers often use them to fly even higher on their wind gliders."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "706640118",
                                                    "speaker": "Honglang",
                                                    "text": "But the distribution of the wind currents in this Domain is a total mess. Some of them even collide with each other, forming areas that can't be flown through."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "706640119",
                                                    "speaker": "Honglang",
                                                    "text": "I invited a few adventurers known to be handy with wind gliders to go in and investigate, but without fail, each one barely made it in before being forced to withdraw."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "706640120",
                                                    "speaker": "Honglang",
                                                    "text": "They also reported finding mechanisms inside, and that activating them seems to affect some of the wind currents..."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "706640121",
                                                    "speaker": "Honglang",
                                                    "text": "But before they could work out the mechanisms' specific uses, a bunch of monsters appeared out of nowhere, so they had to pull out."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "706640122",
                                                    "speaker": "Honglang",
                                                    "text": "After some discussion, we concluded that if we can make clever use of these mechanisms, it should make exploring this Domain a whole lot easier...",
                                                    "choices": [
                                                        {
                                                            "id": "706640123",
                                                            "text": "Have you gone in to explore yourself?",
                                                            "response": [
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "706640125",
                                                                    "speaker": "Honglang",
                                                                    "text": "Come on, don't act like you don't know! I'm, um... not the most physically fit, and I'm not so great with a wind glider either."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "706640126",
                                                                    "speaker": "Honglang",
                                                                    "text": "I can just about manage flights under normal conditions, but when it comes to the situation in this Domain..."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "706640127",
                                                                    "speaker": "Honglang",
                                                                    "text": "If I went in to explore, I'd probably get blown around like a leaf before crashing headlong into a horde of monsters."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "706640128",
                                                                    "speaker": "Honglang",
                                                                    "text": "Traveler, I saw how well you did the last time. You've got decent stamina, and a good head on your shoulders, too..."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "706640129",
                                                                    "speaker": "Honglang",
                                                                    "text": "Would you be willing to help me out once more and explore this Domain?"
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "706640130",
                                                                    "speaker": "Honglang",
                                                                    "text": "As for payment, don't worry. I've got you more than covered.",
                                                                    "choices": [
                                                                        {
                                                                            "id": "706640131",
                                                                            "text": "Okay, I guess I'll try.",
                                                                            "response": [
                                                                                {
                                                                                    "id": "706640132",
                                                                                    "speaker": "Honglang",
                                                                                    "text": "Great, I'm counting on you, then!"
                                                                                }
                                                                            ]
                                                                        },
                                                                        {
                                                                            "id": "706640133",
                                                                            "text": "Is there treasure inside?",
                                                                            "response": [
                                                                                {
                                                                                    "id": "706640134",
                                                                                    "speaker": "Honglang",
                                                                                    "text": "Since we've barely been able to explore this Domain, I can't say for sure..."
                                                                                },
                                                                                {
                                                                                    "id": "706640135",
                                                                                    "speaker": "Honglang",
                                                                                    "text": "But you can keep any treasure that you find while exploring!"
                                                                                },
                                                                                {
                                                                                    "id": "706640136",
                                                                                    "speaker": "Honglang",
                                                                                    "text": "I'm counting on you, Traveler."
                                                                                }
                                                                            ]
                                                                        }
                                                                    ]
                                                                }
                                                            ]
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "id": "706640124",
                                                            "text": "You didn't lead the charge?"
                                                        }
                                                    ]
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "id": "706640111",
                                            "text": "Isn't it a good thing?"
                                        }
                                    ]
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "706640103",
                            "text": "We meet again."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}